  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate transmutation; <strong>CL</strong> 6th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> body; <strong>Price</strong> 4,000 gp (normal), 6,000 gp (layering); <strong>Weight</strong> 4 lbs</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThese long translucent wraps seem to contour to the wearer’s body, clinging to the form of their wearer. If the wearer of this robe possesses the kinetic fist form infusion, the burn cost for that wild talent is reduced by 1. A layering body wraps of kinetic fist can be worn over another body slot item and still provide its effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Wondrous Item, creator must be a 6th level kineticist, kinetic fist; <strong>Cost</strong> 2,000 gp (normal), 3,000 gp (layering)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-magical-items#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
